en:
"Really? I'm counting on you, okay? What I'm about to tell you
is a line of business that surely nobody
on this continent has ever tried."{w}

"But when I took the idea to them,
they told me, 'We cannot stock them
unless their practicality is proven.'"{w}

"And this proof of practicality? They said it means
wearing Caron brand goods and fighting
that school's teachers -- and winning!"{w}

"It's not much of a thank-you, but
I'll let you lot buy Caron brand goods
cheap."{w}{p}"I've marked them down, so buy some before you go."{w}

"Here at this Cathedral, for any worshippers who wish it,
we offer a variety of talks about the gods,
though they run a little long."{w}

"This town has nothing but religion,
but I'm sure one stroll around it will leave you
feeling refreshed!"{w}

"Do my oracles... come true?{w}Haha, forgive me for asking something so odd."{w}{p}"I have been put on a pedestal as the foremost figure
of the Semnadoc faith, but..."{w}{p}"Not one archbishop in history
has ever heard Semnadoc's voice directly."{w}

"They say Semnadoc is not only
the god of space but also the god of laughter."{w}{p}"I'm not joking around, you know.{w}A life without smiles
would be sad, wouldn't it?"{w}

"My, my,
some cute little lambs
have wandered in."{w}{p}"What shall I do?{w}Maybe I'll just send you right back..."{w}{p}"Hmmm..."{w}{p}"......"{w}{p}{0E}"......{0F}Oh well, never mind."{w}{p}"This is Elminage.{w}And I am Hisbert. Nice to meet you."{w}

"Ah, now I remember."{w}{p}"New Land 304972... Orses and Sarijana,
who were trying to relocate life there..."{w}{p}"...forcibly fused it with Urna, the unregistered land.{w}They even revised its system so that life could live there."{w}{p}"As a result, this land became control number 304972,
of the Rade 301 system."{w}

"Honestly, what a pain they caused.{w}They were even so considerate as to change
the land's name to Fiur Rade."{w}{p}"Did they really think something like that
could fool the eyes of the System?"{w}

...Why was that? Despite the words she spat out,
Hisbert's expression seemed fond, as if she were
reminiscing about days long past.{w}

"No way, even the system's the same: 301!"{w}{p}"Back then... that was when Void, god of space,
became chief god, and the plans for creating the Eld
were overhauled across the board."{w}
